{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">CREATE X-DOCUMENT statement</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309181","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/CREATE-X-DOCUMENT-statement.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/CREATE-X-DOCUMENT-statement.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"CREATE-X-DOCUMENT-statement\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">CREATE X-DOCUMENT statement</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Creates a handle for an XML document object.\nTo use the XML document, you must add new nodes using the CREATE-NODE( ) method,\nthe CREATE-NODE-NAMESPACE( ) method, or populate the document\nfrom an existing file using the LOAD( ) method.</p>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> To ensure consistency across all nodes in an XML\ndocument, use either the CREATE-NODE-NAMESPACE( ) method\nor the CREATE-NODE( ) method to build an XML document;\ndo not use both methods within a single document.</div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CREATE-X-DOCUMENT-statement__syntax_GC15BF2684244\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d361822e104\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"CREATE-X-DOCUMENT-statement__idGDG23S2664887\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>CREATE X-DOCUMENT <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> IN WIDGET-POOL <var class=\"keyword varname\">widget-pool-name</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A variable of type HANDLE into which CREATE X-DOCUMENT stores\nthe new handle.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">IN WIDGET-POOL <var class=\"keyword varname\">widget-pool-name </var></dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An expression of type CHARACTER that evaluates, at run time,\nto the name of the widget pool that contains the XML document object.<div class=\"note note note_note\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> Widget pool names are not case-sensitive.</div></dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CREATE-X-DOCUMENT-statement__example_GC15BG2684252\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d361822e169\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">The\nfollowing code fragment depicts creating an XML document object:</p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"CREATE-X-DOCUMENT-statement__idGDG23T2664893\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE hXdoc AS HANDLE NO-UNDO.\n. . .\nCREATE X-DOCUMENT hXdoc.\n. . .</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CREATE-X-DOCUMENT-statement__see-also_GC15BH2684256\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d361822e198\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CREATE-X-NODEREF-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-X-NODEREF-statement.html\">CREATE X-NODEREF statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DELETE-OBJECT-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DELETE-OBJECT-statement.html\">DELETE OBJECT statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"X-document-object-handle.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/X-document-object-handle.html\">X-document object handle</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"X-noderef-object-handle.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/X-noderef-object-handle.html\">X-noderef object handle</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CREATE-WIDGET-POOL-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-WIDGET-POOL-statement.html\">CREATE WIDGET-POOL statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CREATE-X-NODEREF-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-X-NODEREF-statement.html\">CREATE X-NODEREF statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309181","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1470,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"CREATE X-DOCUMENT statement","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-X-DOCUMENT-statement.html","type":"Manual"}